{"availability":"available","full":"shuxiachai/BushfireReadyGPT","name":"BushfireReadyGPT","description":"Australian location + scenario to reviewable preparedness drafts. Hybrid RAG, evidence trails and human review. Local Ollama; password-protected cloud demo. Not emergency decisions.","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"Python","stars":2,"forks":1,"created":"2026-06-23T01:36:24Z","updated":"2026-10-08T03:31:11Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://bushfire-ready-production.up.railway.app","topics":["abs-data","asgs","australia","bushfire","disaster-preparedness","geospatial-data","human-in-the-loop","hybrid-search","llm","local-llm","ollama","python","rag","report-generation","retrieval-augmented-generation","streamlit","wildfire"],"demo":"https://bushfire-ready-production.up.railway.app/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T18:25:12.435Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T18:25:12.435Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T18:25:12.435Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T18:25:12.435Z","stars":2,"forks":1}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["BushfireReadyGPT turns an Australian location, audience, scenario and planning focus into a structured draft bushfire-preparedness report. It is for learning, demonstrations and controlled stakeholder discussion: the application combines declared Australian context, traceable evidence and a required human review rather than acting as a generic emergency chatbot.","The standard installation is local-first: it uses Ollama on the operator's machine, with no OpenAI API key required. A separate, password-protected Docker/Railway demonstration can use private DeepSeek narrative generation and a local CPU RAG index in its container; it is optional and has distinct deployment limits.","Safety boundary: this is not a live incident, evacuation, route, fire-ban, safe-place or life-safety decision system. In an emergency, use official emergency servi